WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,360
If there is danger, run quickly

2
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,960
What the hell is that? It’s disgusting.

3
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,360
There is a faceless monster in front of here and a monster behind it

4
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,260
There are still great people around me.

5
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,360
What crime have I committed, Brother Lin?

6
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,060
That thing is so scary

7
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,060
Almost ate me
